8C%25E3%2581%25A3%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2582%258A%25E7%25AB%258B%25E3%2581%25A1%25E4%25B8%258A%25E3%2581%258C%25E3%2582%2589%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2581%258F%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2581%25A3%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2582%258B%25E7%258F%25BE%25E8%25B1%25A1%25E3%2581%25B8%25E3%2581%25AE%25E5%25AF%25BE%25E5%2587%25A6%25E6%25B3%2595%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D139cd3dc01f46565e353d6d199dbb35c\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-1.2.2%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540hisaruki%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3D88725f18adce614a7fc566e6fb31fcb9\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=4f948f0194685c3625b2e47ec3875834","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/hisaruki/items/53dcb2654e209fc2b076","original_url":"https://qiita.com/hisaruki/items/53dcb2654e209fc2b076"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GjELo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a690378-c131-4a43-b31c-86022e4dc393","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"gnome-terminal-serverはないですね。。これがおかしい？\n```$ systemctl --user status gnome-terminal-server\nUnit gnome-terminal-server.service could not be found.```","ts":"1616228153.137200","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1616228165.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Np6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df0bea67-48e9-435c-9c90-fc778bca80f0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"やっぱり、gnome-terminal-serverが悪さしてそうですね。\nコマンドから起動しても直接起動してもgrep結果に出てくるので","ts":"1616227822.137000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jucm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a424d744-8396-480c-bb32-c18702c67878","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"gnome系のサービスのstatusを確認して再起動するとかで治らないかな\ngnome-terminal-serverとか","ts":"1616227620.135900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ug9Sl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f21e030a-758a-42c5-8afd-99ef522c196b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"sshしてるPCではありますが、ssh先ではないです","ts":"1616227234.134600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5kwao"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c482a2b-f7b3-4a5e-9496-147e418a6953","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これsshとかではないですよね？","ts":"1616227193.134100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i4P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f40a3569-5e64-4daa-9b64-02086b7325d9","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あと、自分が実行した時に、`conao       5487  0.0  0.0 236292  7476 ?        Sl   08:50   0:00 /usr/bin/gnome-keyring-daemon --start --foreground --components=secrets`\nがないからこの辺怪しそう","ts":"1616227175.133800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wbJR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a7cd384-0b11-448d-beb7-e94f3639a4de","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ、これgnome-system-monitorデーモンで起動してるな","ts":"1616227142.133100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BHj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f93df57d-61a3-451d-895e-714c6348c6e0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そうなんですよね。家のmanjaroでは問題ないんですが、会社においてるPCで何故か開けなくなってしまった。。","ts":"1616227025.132600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Amlbn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de936317-fe93-41f9-99fa-d841124570ba","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"こうなりました。\n```[conao@conao-manjaro-ouranos ~]$ ps aux | grep gnome\nconao       1116  0.0  0.0 236556  6660 ?        Sl   08:50   0:00 /usr/bin/gnome-keyring-daemon --daemonize --login\nconao       1178  0.0  0.0 160836  7488 ?        Sl   08:50   0:06 /usr/lib/at-spi2-registryd --use-gnome-session\nconao       1974  0.0  0.0 224628 28484 ?        Sl   08:50   0:00 /usr/lib/polkit-gnome/polkit-gnome-authentication-agent-1\nconao       2467  0.2  0.1 627312 60720 ?        Sl   08:50   1:23 gnome-system-monitor\nconao       5487  0.0  0.0 236292  7476 ?        Sl   08:50   0:00 /usr/bin/gnome-keyring-daemon --start --foreground --components=secrets\nconao      45683  0.0  0.0   6400  2224 pts/2    S+   16:55   0:00 grep --colour=auto gnome```","ts":"1616226990.131900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xdV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20049fe4-c9bb-454e-a9f9-1a4d3d95cb0a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"とりあえず psでプロセス確認してみると良さそう","ts":"1616226670.131600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KG4AW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bee12392-9555-4d3b-911d-04baca3641c2","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今、xface環境作って試してみたけど特に問題はないですね…何だろプロセスは動いてますか？","ts":"1616226642.130900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iwiz5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72b3335d-0739-489e-90cd-0335be023f61","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"スクリーンショットはgnome-system-monitorを起動してみて、表示されず、yayで再インストールしても表示されなかったターミナルです。","ts":"1616224384.129900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=b5C"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"gnome-system-monitorの見た目が好きでxfceを使っているのにこれだけ入れてるんですが、なぜか最近起動しなくなってしまいました。(窓が表示されない)\nこの場合、どこを見たらいいのでしょうか。ターミナルは\u0026amp;を付けていないのに非同期で起動しているように見えます。","ts":"1616224331.129500","files":[{"id":"F01RXMRKU1Y","created":1616224155,"timestamp":1616224155,"name":"Screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02.png","title":"Screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":54107,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y/download/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02.png","original_h":485,"original_w":757,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y-f31d165ef9/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y-f31d165ef9/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y-f31d165ef9/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02_160.png","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y-f31d165ef9/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02_360.png","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":360,"thumb_360_h":231,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y-f31d165ef9/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02_480.png","thumb_480_w":480,"thumb_480_h":308,"thumb_720":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y-f31d165ef9/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02_720.png","thumb_720_w":720,"thumb_720_h":461,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/UDPT2BZ6E/F01RXMRKU1Y/screenshot_2021-03-20_16-09-02.png","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F01RXMRKU1Y-231b35f2b9","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":n